flowchart LR
    Owner[Dog owner]
    Video[Consented video or optional webcam]

    subgraph Device[User device — local privacy boundary]
        direction LR
        ModelPkg[Versioned model package]

        subgraph UI[Desktop UI — D1 open]
            direction TB
            Screens[Profiles and consent<br/>Video player and timeline<br/>Report preview and export]
        end

        subgraph Core[Application core]
            direction TB
            API[Application API]
            Services[Media, sessions, reports<br/>Analysis orchestration]
            Repo[Repository]
            DB[(Local database — D4 open)]
            VideoStore[(Local video storage)]
        end

        subgraph Worker[Separate local ML worker]
            direction TB
            Sampler[Frame sampler]
            Pose[PosePort adapter]
            Tracker[Tracking and smoothing]
            Features[Temporal feature extraction]
            Classifier[Behaviour classifier]
        end
    end

    Owner --> Screens
    Video -->|import locally| Screens
    Screens <--> API
    API --> Services
    Services --> Repo
    Repo <--> DB
    Services --> VideoStore
    Services -->|analysis request| Sampler
    VideoStore -->|local frames| Sampler
    ModelPkg -. verified locally .-> Pose
    Sampler --> Pose --> Tracker --> Features --> Classifier
    Classifier -->|events, intervals, confidence, model version| Services

